WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
- Take it away Jane.

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.780
- All right darling. Now Kelly,

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:03.718
I am going to ask you
a series of questions.

00:00:03.718 --> 00:00:04.551
- [Kelly] Yes.

00:00:04.551 --> 00:00:06.330
- About Texas!

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:07.163
- [Kelly] Oh god.

00:00:07.163 --> 00:00:08.310
- Taking it easy on her because you

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:09.350
should probably know all these.

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:10.210
- Wait, what?

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:11.857
I haven't lived there in a while. Okay.

00:00:11.857 --> 00:00:12.852
- But you had to take,

00:00:12.852 --> 00:00:14.363
in grade school every kid
in Texas has to take--

00:00:14.363 --> 00:00:16.788
- Which I was super great in grade school.

00:00:16.788 --> 00:00:20.300
- (mumbles) take all those
tests about your state history.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:23.210
You'll have 45 seconds to
get five correct answers.

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:24.310
So, 45 seconds--
- Okay.

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:25.470
- Five correct answers--
- Okay.

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:27.410
- If you're not sure you can pass

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:28.850
and come back to the question, okay?

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:30.030
But here is the catch.

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.040
Before we get started,

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:32.570
please put this Apple watch on.

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:33.510
- Apple watch on, okay.

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:36.720
- The watch is hooked
up to my watch, okay.

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.980
If your heart rate--

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:40.699
We're monitoring her heart rate.

00:00:40.699 --> 00:00:45.350
If your heart rate goes
above 100, you lose.

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:46.908
- Dang!

00:00:46.908 --> 00:00:47.790
Okay (breathes in).
- [Jane] All right. Now,

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:50.400
and this is a decibel counter, all right.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:54.003
If it goes above 70 decibels,

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:57.010
which is like, normal conversation

00:00:57.010 --> 00:00:59.200
with normal people like us.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:02.660
If she goes above that, you lose.

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:03.493
All right?

00:01:03.493 --> 00:01:05.380
You'll be branded the most aggressive

00:01:05.380 --> 00:01:06.750
and the most deranged player

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:09.420
in Hollywood Game Night history.

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:11.160
- I am okay with that (chuckles).

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:13.910
- [Jane] And, if you do win that title,

00:01:13.910 --> 00:01:15.520
which means you've lost,

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:17.650
would mean that you make a
thousand dollar contribution

00:01:17.650 --> 00:01:19.784
to Red Nose Day in my name.

00:01:19.784 --> 00:01:20.820
- Oh.

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:21.653
Well now I kinda wanna lose.

00:01:21.653 --> 00:01:22.766
- Its not bad.

00:01:22.766 --> 00:01:24.508
- Now I kinda wanna lose.

00:01:24.508 --> 00:01:26.720
- Now, if you win,

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:28.460
and you could.

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:30.980
I will make a one-thousand dollar donation

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:32.470
to Red Nose Day in your name.

00:01:32.470 --> 00:01:34.150
- Okay, okay, okay.

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:37.062
- [Jane] So you accept
this challenge, I take it?

00:01:37.062 --> 00:01:38.390
- I accept your challenge, Jane Lynch.

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:40.740
- All right, let's get her the clock up.

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:42.160
Where's the clock? Clock
is right over here.

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:43.290
- Okay, clock is right here. Okay.

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:44.720
- And where are my cards?

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:45.680
- Here.
- Oh gosh.

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:47.823
Okay. Like I've never done this before.

00:01:47.823 --> 00:01:49.323
- (laughs) Oh wait.

00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:51.500
- Go!

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:54.049
How many stars are
there on the Texas flag?

00:01:54.049 --> 00:01:55.120
- What?

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:56.230
- [Jane] How many stars?

00:01:56.230 --> 00:01:57.108
- One.

00:01:57.108 --> 00:01:58.580
(bell dings)
- Very good, very good.

00:01:58.580 --> 00:01:59.497
And you stayed nice and calm.

00:01:59.497 --> 00:02:02.450
"Don't mess with Texas" was
originally a message about what?

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:03.670
- Littering (bell dings) Oh!

00:02:03.670 --> 00:02:05.470
- That is correct. Down, down, down.

00:02:06.568 --> 00:02:07.770
- Sorry, sorry.

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:11.470
- Name two presidents who
were born in Texas, born.

00:02:11.470 --> 00:02:12.670
- Lyndon B. Johnson? No.

00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:13.990
- [Jane] Yes, yes. And?

00:02:13.990 --> 00:02:16.490
- Lyndon B. Johnson and George W. Bush!

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:17.990
- No, (buzzer) he was born in Connecticut.

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:20.030
- Oh but he lives there.
- Well it doesn't matter.

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:21.020
I said, "born".

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:23.010
Dwight D. Eisenhower, which I didn't know.

00:02:23.010 --> 00:02:26.700
Name four nations that have
ruled over Texas, four.

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:27.553
- Four.

00:02:27.553 --> 00:02:30.720
(stutters) Like Mexico?
Like, that kind of thing?

00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:32.580
- Mexico.
- [Kelly] Mexico.

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:33.413
I don't know.

00:02:33.413 --> 00:02:34.547
- [Jane] Spain.
- Spain!

00:02:34.547 --> 00:02:36.160
- [Jane] Republic of--
- Republic of Europe!

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:38.431
(buzzer)
- [Both] Oh!

00:02:38.431 --> 00:02:39.971
(applause)

00:02:39.971 --> 00:02:41.893
- I don't know.

00:02:41.893 --> 00:02:43.201
Oh shoot!

00:02:43.201 --> 00:02:45.640
(audience laughter)

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:48.460
- I'm sorry but you did
not succeed and you swore.

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:50.650
- I said shoot! I said shoot!

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:53.330
- No, no. You only got
two questions right.

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:55.928
Your heartbeat went up to 132.

00:02:55.928 --> 00:02:56.761
- Oh god!

00:02:58.590 --> 00:03:01.133
- And you hit 99 decibels.

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:03.720
It is official ladies and gentlemen,

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:06.761
she is the most aggressive
and deranged player

00:03:06.761 --> 00:03:08.839
in Hollywood Game Night history.

00:03:08.839 --> 00:03:11.039
- You know what? I will
drink to that, Jane.

